WEBVTT

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.070
We have a new product!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.530
Try it! Try it!

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.450
Can I have one?

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.780
Sure, there you go.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.700
Here.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.370
Thank you so much!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.670
Hey...

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:08.800
Let me have it!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.090
They stopped moving.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.130
Does that mean--

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.710
What are you doing?

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.340
Sorry!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.140
Are you all right?

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.690
Please come back here!
What just happened?

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.860
Thank you for your patronage.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.320
Thank you for your patronage.

